<item>
			<title>Phil Flynn on Trump's 'secret oil mission,' stable oil prices</title>
			<link>https://video.foxnews.com/v/6398169072112/?playlist_id=1768193258001</link>
			<description>FOX Business' Phil Flynn analyzes President Donald Trump's 'secret oil mission' through the Strait of Hormuz. Flynn credits U.S. military efforts for preventing oil prices from spiking higher, despite tensions with Iran. He notes Iran's oil production is falling, making Kharg Island a focal point.</description>
			<dc:description>FOX Business' Phil Flynn discusses President Donald Trump's revelation of a covert mission to move millions of barrels of oil through the Strait of Hormuz undetected.</dc:description>
